WEBVTT

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:01.829
These gamma waves
are particularly important

00:01:01.871 --> 00:01:06.704
for synchronizing brain activity
to process new information

00:01:06.746 --> 00:01:10.246
from the senses and for
learning and memory.

00:01:11.579 --> 00:01:14.163
You might be surprised to learn

00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:19.996
that when these gamma waves
are weaker than they should be,

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:23.954
this may contribute
to Alzheimer's disease.

00:01:24.913 --> 00:01:29.038
Indeed, my laboratory
and others have shown

00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:32.413
that in people with Alzheimer's